<title>INDIA: India's MTNL down 6.3 pct on NSE.</title>
<headline>India's MTNL down 6.3 pct on NSE.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of India's  state-run telecom firm Mahanagar Telephone Nigam Ltd (MTNL) fell 13.50 rupees or 6.3 percent to 201 on the National Stock Exchange in afternoon trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>They said MTNL shares fell 11.50 rupees to 203 on the Bombay bourse.  </p>
<p>Traders said a couple of funds were sellers in the stock.</p>
<p>&quot;Fundamentally there's no new news that should pull the share price lower,&quot; said a telecom analyst at a foreign brokerage.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
